## Verification update (2026-09-16)

IPC authentication/integration tests and reporting tests pass. Report commands
collect actual daemon evidence, preserve unavailable sections, and support JSON,
HTML, and PDF. Compliance reports retrieve patch, CIS and policy evidence; missing services
produce incomplete reports. They do not certify regulatory compliance. See ../docs/TODO_PROGRESS.md for remaining work.
